// a detour the engine can call on a worker, and both would otherwise insert into or erase from a std::map that the main
// thread walks with a live iterator every tick - which is a free-and-reuse, not a race on a number.
const unsigned int kOutGone = 0xFFFFFFF2u;          // a queue-only kind: the engine DESTROYED this platoon off the main thread; the drain applies the delete a bound group is owed
