// changed the cause string on it, from `teardown` to `stale-lease`. This is review-p6j HIGH-1, and the fix is at
// the loss rather than at the gate: WHILE THE NOTEBOOK PROCESS IS LINKED THE AREA MAP IS KEPT THROUGH A TEARDOWN.
// Why that is safe and better, stated rather than assumed. The relay republishes the whole map every second and
// ApplyRelayAreaMap replaces all four grids and both clocks wholesale.
