// the player-sector halo and the peer halo, this game's loaded set and player sector, and the session-link-only
// containers (g_clientMap, g_peerLoaded, g_map) the relay never writes.
// WITH NO RELAY THE FULL WIPE STANDS. Nothing would refresh a kept grid, and a frozen map is a claim about the
// world that nobody is maintaining - the E25.7 mistake in another place.
